{"type":"json_object","message":"The balance of unrecognized tax benefits at the end of fiscal 2007 is the beginning-of-year 2008 balance, $126.6 million; the balance at the end of fiscal 2008 is $214.4 million. The net change over that one-year interval is ending 2008 minus beginning 2008, in USD millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"214.4 - 126.6","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"beginning_2008_equiv_end_2007":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t1c1n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","beginning_2008_equiv_end_2007":"source:t1c1n0"}}}